[gd_resource type="Theme" load_steps=10 format=3]

; The menu's only theme.
;
; One resource rather than per-node overrides, because the menu will grow tabs
; and every tab that dresses its own buttons is a tab that looks slightly wrong.
; scripts/ui/ sets colours in code in exactly one place — the item tile tint,
; which comes from data/items/items.json and cannot be a theme entry.
;
; Colours are the Meadows palette from data/config/palette.json, darkened: the
; menu sits over a lit meadow and has to read as a surface in front of it rather
; than as text floating on grass. accent is flower_gold (#d9b340), which is the
; palette's one warm highlight and is not reserved (tether_oxblood is).
;
; FOCUS IS THE LOUDEST STATE HERE. This ships on a handheld with no cursor, so
; "which thing am I about to press" has to be readable at arm's length on a
; 7-inch screen. The focus stylebox is a 3px gold border plus a lifted fill; a
; subtle focus ring is a menu nobody can drive with a stick.

[sub_resource type="StyleBoxFlat" id="panel"]
